+## Chart Lens proportion refinement — 2026-10-09
+
+- **Scope:** Thinned the lens ring from 5 to 3.2 SVG units (36%) and handle from 8 to 5.2 (35%), shortened the handle and placed the chart farther inside the lens. Chart width is 24 instead of 32 units, with a 2.8-unit stroke instead of 3.5. Retained the original green/orange identity, existing header sizes and shared favicon asset.
+- **Checks:** Visually inspected before/after at 128, 34, 30 and 16 px. Production build passes existing asset limits. All 7,563 build assets compared with the preceding release: only `logo-chart-lens.svg` changed. All 499 favicon declarations and 498 branded headers remain valid. Homepage and guides verified at 1440, 390 and 320 px, with loaded artwork, no overlap/overflow and no browser script or asset errors; homepage chart renders. No new unit tests or repeat calculation tests were needed for the SVG-only change.
+- **Publication:** Published to https://stockvaluelens.com as Cloudflare version `13ce3121-e508-4d6d-b4e5-57749fe12760`. Seven live resources return HTTP 200 and match the tested build; SVG has image/svg+xml content type. Live homepage/guides checks pass at all three widths.
+- **Maintenance review:** Routine logo proportion refinement; no PROJECT_LOG, ISSUE_LOG or public-history entry required. Website source remains outside Git; the updated SVG, focused follow-up patch, before/after image and live verification are saved in stock-industry-analysis for commit/push.
